                                    <div class="faq-section" style="margin-top:40px;">
                                        <h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
                                        <h3>What is Kama Ayurveda's biggest advantage?</h3>
                                        <p>Classical Ayurvedic authenticity + luxury retail experience + international presence + long-term brand-consistency. 22+ years of category leadership.</p>
                                        <h3>Kama vs Forest Essentials?</h3>
                                        <p>Different positioning within luxury Ayurveda. Both defined category. Kama slightly more classical + international-caliber; Forest Essentials broader luxury + retail-scaled. Coexist.</p>
                                        <h3>Can new luxury Ayurveda brands compete?</h3>
                                        <p>In sub-category niching (single-ingredient specialty, regional-Ayurveda specialty, specific-ritual focus). Kama + Forest Essentials dominate broad luxury.</p>
                                        <h3>What is the biggest luxury Ayurveda lesson?</h3>
                                        <p>Authenticity + physical retail + international expansion + restraint combined. Not aggressive-scaling D2C playbook. Different rules.</p>
